{"sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","items":[{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k001","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"IR은 진동 중 쌍극자 변화가 있는 모드를 검출한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k002","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"O–H는 흔히 넓은 3200–3600 cm⁻¹, carboxylic acid O–H는 2500–3300 부근 매우 넓은 띠, carbonyl C=O는 대체로 1650–1800 부근 강한 띠를 보인다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k003","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"결합·공액·수소결합 등에 따라 위치가 달라진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k004","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"질량분석에서 m/z는 질량 대 전하 비이며 분자 이온 또는 관련 이온으로 분자량을 추정한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k005","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"Cl의 M:M+2는 약 3:1, Br은 약 1:1의 대표 패턴이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k006","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"¹H NMR chemical shift는 전자 차폐 환경을 반영하며 δ(ppm)로 표시한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k007","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"적분은 정량 조건에서 신호를 만드는 proton 수와 관련된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k008","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"단순 1차 결합에서 등가 이웃 proton n개는 n+1 분할을 만들 수 있으나 등가성, 장거리 coupling 및 강결합 등 예외가 있다. ¹³C NMR 신호 수는 구별되는 탄소 환경을 나타낸다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k009","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"불포화도 DBE=(2C+2+N−H−X)/2는 일반적인 중성 유기 분자식에서 고리 및 π결합 수를 추정한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k010","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"IR은 작용기, NMR은 국소 화학 환경, MS는 m/z와 분해 정보를 제공한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k011","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"DBE에서 O는 보통 계산에 포함하지 않는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k012","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"NMR n+1은 모든 스펙트럼에 적용되는 절대 규칙이 아니다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k013","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"δ가 큰 쪽은 downfield이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-analysis--spectroscopy-k014","sectionId":"organic-analysis/spectroscopy","unitId":"organic-analysis","subject":"chemistry","text":"4이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]}]}